{"data":{"body":"**P1:** This fallback runs only when `_notify_parent_of_terminal_child()` is called. Startup never scans persisted terminal children, so a child completed before shutdown or a lost notification leaves its parent STARTED forever. Reconcile terminal linked children during startup, or use a persistent notification outbox, and test automatic recovery across an actual restart.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7wf-jD","finding_digest":"37e024583fa24dc83171a92690d19d6ec04a473f6ff95d054e9e080bd309dfa8","finding_id":"arf_v1_g7qciwb7ujg4qmlrvetjbum5n3","finding_key":"testing/executor.py::_notify_parent_of_terminal_child::persistent-link-recovery","identity_key":"testing/executor.py::_notify_parent_of_terminal_child::persistent-link-recovery","line":1852,"observation_digest":"adcff7aaa9043182e01ec402d0e5fb375aff62ac4b0558b8d6083da30adaab53","observation_id":"aro_v1_vxh7pkvjaqyyfya6yqbnbzp3g5","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/executor.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_g7qciwb7ujg4qmlrvetjbum5n3","published_at":"2026-09-17T08:52:41Z","review_id":"arr_v1_xsrr7eksstd5bhluxvdunv7xkn","reviewed_base_sha":"cf4d27f59c2bf14f87c3ef75f58fc0881b2e2c34","reviewed_head_sha":"75207a5f280325db0836892471924779f0f7bcc8","reviewer":"codex","start_line":1845,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":731},"record_id":"art_v1_ppwzfektktq3jyyogy3vbr66ri","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-17T08:52:41Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
